{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>[Fair of appearance, very.</b> Before she gave birth, but not afterward, for 'fair of appearance she is.' <b>A virgin.</b> The Sages: what is the novelty for the one who says she was three years old — her virginity returns even if she was already had relations.]."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:05:33.289984379Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}